[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=15 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="主档案室下沉了半层。打捞索要穿过原来的天窗，窗口边沿全是旧电缆。拉姆森试着拉一下，发现里面还有一根绳连着别的东西。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="不能硬拖。先让船稳住，我下索，把外面这根解开。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我们能给你多少时间？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="安全的时候越多越好。危险的时候零秒也得走。别先答应一个你守不住的数字。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="搜索受到攻击会中断，可以撤开再续。先避开蓄力落点，等空当再开始，不要把“还差一点”当成继续挨打的理由。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你在图上把搜索点圈出来，又画了两条不同的退出线。弗莱彻看完，帮你在第二条线边补了一道浅滩。以前她会直接替你画完，现在先等你看见。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="有一份东西我们不带。里面如果有要接入我才能打开的部分，先封着。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="你确定？那也许是你要找的。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我确定现在不接。我不是确定以后永远不想。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="这两句我替你记着。免得等会儿有人只听后半句。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把自己的耳机交给帕金斯，换了一副只收小队频道的。它的声音不太好，左边总有一点底噪。你反倒觉得这副更容易相信，因为哪里坏了，大家都知道。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="按刚才的顺序来。取档案，确认封存，离开。谁想起别的事，都等出了攻击范围再说。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

